    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037900/extras/79a4fcccff7bf58efc3de286c7cb4d8d.avif?t=1555408756\" /></div><br><br>Fight This is a battle-packed game where you're to confront hordes of enemies as well as gravitation. Fight non-stop, try out all the techniques and show dexterity dodging the enemy\u2019s attacks. Unlock new abilities of your characters to make them stronger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037900/extras/8f1776f3e87322f03d11aa0827a15f98.avif?t=1555408756\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENDLESS FIGHTS</h2>Dozens of bloodthirsty enemies are just asking for trouble, and you\u2019re about to give them what they want.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOT COMBOS</h2>Upgrade your skills, learn new combos and try them on your opponents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TWO GAME MODES</h2>Fight here below or in the air, jumping from one platform to another.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037900/extras/378f62d4d80f3a1d75b59b40d613f483.avif?t=1555408756\" /></div><br><br>Get to grips with your enemies and show them that they messed up with a wrong guy!",
